WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Let’s unpack your travel companion. Pause, choose a chapter or set your speed.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Welcome to Wondercase. Open the app using your TD’s link.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Travelers do not need a TD login to explore the

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
app. Follow the itinerary from Hanoi through Vietnam and Cambodia

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.000
to Thailand. Your departure’s dates appear in the app. Use

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.000
the tabs at the bottom to explore. This guide works

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.000
for any departure and any assigned TD.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.600
Install on your phone. Open the app link in Safari

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:44.200
on iPhone or Chrome on Android. Choose Add to Home

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.800
Screen (or Install app), then confirm. Browser wording can vary.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:51.400
Use More → Help & Tutorials for the detailed iPhone

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:55.000
and Android videos.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Your daily schedule. Home shows each day’s date, city and

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.000
schedule. Choose a day with the arrows or calendar. Follow

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Hanoi, Hue, Da Nang, Hoi An and Saigon, then Siem

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Reap, Chiang Mai and Bangkok. Read the TD’s announcement and

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.000
check again before leaving the hotel. Times and activities may

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.000
change.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Explore with the TD’s maps. Tap Hanoi, Da Nang, Saigon,

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Siem Reap, Chiang Mai or Bangkok on the large map

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.000
to open the TD’s map. Angkor Wat opens the TD’s

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Siem Reap map. Hue uses its available uploaded map or

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.000
a Google search. City tiles below the map offer the

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.000
same maps and any additional maps the TD shares.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Essentials for the journey. Open Essentials for hotel details, internal

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.000
flights, local guides and available handouts. Vedana Lagoon Resort is

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:40.000
a lunch stop on this itinerary, not an overnight hotel.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.000
Check the Hotels section for your actual overnight stays. Review

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.000
shared documents online. Download a needed PDF before setting out;

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.000
current flight and schedule updates take priority.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.600
Join our photo gallery. Tap Gallery. It opens the group’s

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:56.200
photo gallery directly. If you have not joined on this

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:59.800
browser, follow the gallery’s Join instructions. Returning members enter according

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:03.400
to the gallery’s saved membership. Safe sign-in does not sign

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:07.000
you into the gallery.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.571
The Group and meal choices. the TD reveals the guest

00:02:09.571 --> 00:02:12.143
list when it is ready. Your guest card includes Safe

00:02:12.143 --> 00:02:14.714
and Meal choices links. Open Meal choices from your guest

00:02:14.714 --> 00:02:17.286
card and add dietary restrictions or allergies at the top.

00:02:17.286 --> 00:02:19.857
Choose the meals the TD has made visible. Submit each

00:02:19.857 --> 00:02:22.429
meal or all open meals, and check the confirmation and

00:02:22.429 --> 00:02:25.000
deadline on each menu.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.571
Your private Traveler Safe. Open your own guest card’s Safe.

00:02:27.571 --> 00:02:30.143
Activate your assigned Safe ID with a six-digit PIN on

00:02:30.143 --> 00:02:32.714
your first visit. Keep the recovery code somewhere private. Return

00:02:32.714 --> 00:02:35.286
with your Safe ID and PIN; use recovery if needed.

00:02:35.286 --> 00:02:37.857
Save personal PDFs or photos and calendar plans in your

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:40.429
Safe. Lock it when finished; downloaded files remain on your

00:02:40.429 --> 00:02:43.000
device.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.600
Discover more. Open More → Learn More for historical trivia

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:50.200
about places on this itinerary. Choose the Language lessons tile

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:53.800
for useful local phrases. Use Help Wondercase Grow to share

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:57.400
feedback. Return on the same browser and device to update

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:01.000
it.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.250
Help whenever you need it. Use More → Help &

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:05.500
Tutorials for the interactive walkthrough, printable guide and phone installation

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.750
videos. These explain the app controls; the current schedule is

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.000
always in the app. Internet is needed for updated schedules,

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.250
Safe content and shared photos. Downloaded PDFs and videos can

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:14.500
be opened on your device. Use The Group for your

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.750
TD’s contact details. Never include passwords or private documents in

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.000
feedback.
